 store availability for a product, and reserve it in store.</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2 8.913l4 4 8-7.999L12.587 3.5z\"></path></g></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-body\">Exclusive Loyalty Program</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small\">Get extended warranty, access to exclusive events and cash points on purchases</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2 8.913l4 4 8-7.999L12.587 3.5z\"></path></g></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-body\">Exchange products purchased on our website</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small\">Full price products bought from Norrøna online can be exchanged in store</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2 8.913l4 4 8-7.999L12.587 3.5z\"></path></g></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-body\">Experienced Staff</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small\">Highly trained staff with extensive outdoor and product experience</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2 8.913l4 4 8-7.999L12.587 3.5z\"></path></g></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-body\">Curb side pickup</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small\">You can arrange a curb side pickup with this store</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2 8.913l4 4 8-7.999L12.587 3.5z\"></path></g></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-body\">30 Days Return</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small\">Unused products can be returned for a refund for 30 days after purchase</p><!----><!----></div></li><li style=\"gap:4px;\" class=\"storepage-card-feature\"><div class=\"check-icon\" style=\"margin-top:4px;min-width:16px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Check\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"false\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#FCFCFC\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M12.585 3.5L6 10.085 3.414 7.5 2