"avatarMedia\":1890,\"body\":1920,\"country\":1975,\"featuredMedia\":1976,\"isHighlighted\":84,\"location\":1855,\"personCategory\":1986,\"seo\":1995,\"slug\":2019,\"text\":2021,\"title\":2022},\"2026-10-15T10:02:10Z\",\"66400f22-8ae2-4b7c-b403-4100f72e352e\",\"jGgh7CU8v8JSnfJnTUALN6\",{\"base\":1866},{\"id\":1863,\"rev\":1867},\"f6XEDFLbzWZ91LZoNVU4wf\",\"personPage\",\"2026-11-02T10:07:01Z\",[1871,1875,1878,1881,1884],{\"_key\":1872,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1874},\"5bfb21a829d63b034a3bbc0d3d5b0dc7\",\"internationalizedArrayRichTextValue\",\"en\",{\"_key\":1876,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1877},\"9859d137c11cb1a25dc5d10c03cdaa8c\",\"no\",{\"_key\":1879,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1880},\"a2778129af4f4af942dcc7441e6d4b79\",\"sv\",{\"_key\":1882,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1883},\"f8e681eabc55031863801678e91dada5\",\"fr\",{\"_key\":1885,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1886},\"bdc0a549c0e9ed5f6dd3313e9b39cc75\",\"de\",{\"_type\":1821,\"fetchMode\":1888},\"id\",{\"src\":83},{\"_type\":1821,\"fetchMode\":1822,\"filterId\":1891,\"filterName\":1891,\"mediaItems\":1892},\"personavatar\",[1893],{\"_key\":1894,\"_type\":1721,\"altText\":1895,\"center\":1899,\"height\":1915,\"id\":1894,\"name\":1916,\"pathCdn\":1917,\"type\":1918,\"width\":1919},\"1nZ_d8zWyasq9CeI9sjyrWmtrDWyO1exM-7cbba9a689a7408c93bd23666773cedc.jpeg\",[1896],{\"_key\":1874,\"_type\":1897,\"language\":1874,\"value\":1898},\"internationalizedArrayStringValue\",\"Smiling woman wearing blue glasses and a Norrøna coat, with London's Tower Bridge blurred in the background.\",[1900,1906,1911],{\"_key\":1901,\"_type\":1829,\"aspectRatio\":34,\"bottomRightX\":1902,\"bottomRightY\":1903,\"fileId\":1894,\"id\":1904,\"isManual\":84,\"topLeftX\":1727,\"topLeftY\":1905},\"219983\",0.9989,0.9037084291187739,219983,0.19590842911877396,{\"_key\":1907,\"_type\":1829,\"aspectRatio\":46,\"bottomRightX\":1902,\"bottomRightY\":1908,\"fileId\":1894,\"id\":1909,\"isManual\":84,\"topLeftX\":1727,\"topLeftY\":1910},\"219984\",0.7039,219984,0.35,{\"_key\":1912,\"_type\":1829,\"aspectRatio\":1739,\"bottomRightX\":1902,\"bottomRightY\":1742,\"fileId\":1894,\"id\":1913,\"isManual\":84,\"topLeftX\":1914,\"topLeftY\":1727},\"219985\",219985,0.2936,3475,\"Anna_Chmielowska_Store_Manager_Flagship_London.jpeg\",\"Auto\\u002FAnna_Chmielowska_Store_Manager_Flagship_London\",\"jpeg\",2462,[1921,1935,1945,1955,1965],{\"_key\":1922,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1874,\"value\":1923},\"0aceda3981904a3df4b9861521edb63c\",[1924],{\"_key\":1925,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":1927,\"markDefs\":1933,\"style\":1934},\"f5cbbec1711b\",\"block\",[1928],{\"_key\":1929,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":1931,\"text\":1932},\"8540ae76727b\",\"span\",[],\"Anna, our London Store Manager, was raised near Poland’s Tatra Mountains, she brings over eight years of premium outdoor retail leadership. When she’s not in the store, you’ll find her running ultramarathons, cycling long distances or swimming in cold water. Come say hi!\",[],\"normal\",{\"_key\":1936,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1877,\"value\":1937},\"df0882ad2005c9f9c14ffc616ea3b04d\",[1938],{\"_key\":1925,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":1939,\"markDefs\":1944,\"style\":1934},[1940],{\"_key\":1941,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":1942,\"text\":1943},\"dd6ce54da78e\",[],\"Anna, butikksjefen vår i London, vokste opp i nærheten av Tatrafjellene i Polen og har over åtte års ledererfaring fra eksklusiv friluftsdetaljhandel. Når hun ikke er i butikken, finner du henne gjerne på ultramaraton, lange sykkelturer eller svømmeturer i kaldt vann. Kom innom og si hei!\",[],{\"_key\":1946,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1880,\"value\":1947},\"7ad3d638fbbc1a3cc7707ff82bba615c\",[1948],{\"_key\":1925,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":1949,\"markDefs\":1954,\"style\":1934},[1950],{\"_key\":1951,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":1952,\"text\":1953},\"6324d901a89b\",[],\"Anna, vår butikschef i London, växte upp nära Tatrabergen i Polen och har över åtta års erfarenhet av ledarskap inom premiumsegmentet för friluftsprodukter. När hon inte är i butiken hittar du henne på ultramaraton, långa cykelturer eller simmandes i kallt vatten. Kom gärna förbi och säg hej!\",[],{\"_key\":1956,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1883,\"value\":1957},\"51505b4cc1ada610d273dc8266f265c5\",[1958],{\"_key\":1925,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":1959,\"markDefs\":1964,\"style\":1934},[1960],{\"_key\":1961,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":1962,\"text\":1963},\"638f7664a2c5\",[],\"Anna, responsable de notre boutique de Londres, a grandi près des Tatras, en Pologne, et possède plus de huit ans d’expérience dans la direction de boutiques haut de gamme spécialisées dans les activités de plein air. Lorsqu’elle n’est pas en boutique, vous la trouverez en train de courir des ultramarathons, de parcourir de longues distances à vélo ou de nager en eau froide. Venez lui dire bonjour !\",[],{\"_key\":1966,\"_type\":1873,\"language\":1886,\"value\":1967},\"fbb567808e18c5945cdcf2368dd2d707\",[1968],{\"_key\":1925,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":1969,\"markDefs\":1974,\"style\":1934},[1970],{\"_key\":1971,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":1972,\"text\":1973},\"84430f9d9c65\",[],\"Anna, unsere Store Managerin in London, ist in der Nähe des polnischen Tatra-Gebirges aufgewachsen und verfügt über mehr als acht Jahre Führungserfahrung im gehobenen Outdoor-Einzelhandel. Wenn sie nicht im Store ist, läuft sie Ultramarathons, fährt lange Strecken mit dem Rad oder schwimmt im kalten Wasser. Schaut vorbei und sagt Hallo!\",[],\"United Kingdom\",{\"_type\":1821,\"fetchMode\":1822,\"filterId\":1977,\"filterName\":1977,\"mediaItems\":1978},\"personpagehero\",[1979],{\"_key\":1894,\"_type\":1721,\"altText\":1980,\"center\":1982,\"height\":1915,\"id\":1894,\"name\":1916,\"pathCdn\":1917,\"type\":1918,\"width\":1919},[1981],{\"_key\":1874,\"_type\":1897,\"language\":1874,\"value\":1898},[1983,1984,1985],{\"_key\":1901,\"_type\":1829,\"aspectRatio\":34,\"bottomRightX\":1902,\"bottomRightY\":1903,\"fileId\":1894,\"id\":1904,\"isManual\":84,\"topLeftX\":1727,\"topLeftY\":1905},{\"_k