øna gear stands on a snow-covered mountain peak with a pair of skis and ski poles.  A vast expanse of snow-capped mountains and a glistening body of water stretch out below. \\n\",[2062,2067,2072,2076,2082,2088],{\"t\":2063},[2064,1739,1910,1727,2065,2066],1294,0.675,0.9988,{\"t\":2068},[2069,46,1727,2070,1742,2071],1295,0.1142,0.8846,{\"t\":2073},[2074,34,2075,1727,1730,2066],1296,0.2,{\"t\":2077},[2078,2079,2080,1727,2081,34],35295,1.18,0.2329095432008315,0.9989095432008315,{\"t\":2083},[2084,2085,2086,1727,2087,34],35296,0.66,0.2729244688282701,0.7023052938269922,{\"t\":2089},[2090,2091,2092,1727,2093,34],35297,0.4,0.3038172803325893,0.5638172803325894,3255,\"FW1718-lofoten-Lofoten_54009@SverreHjørnevik-v1.jpg\",\"Auto\\u002FFW1718-lofoten-Lofoten_54009@SverreHjørnevik-v1\",[2098],{\"_key\":2099,\"color\":2100,\"concept\":9,\"gender\":2101,\"model\":2102,\"name\":2103,\"score\":1727},\"1034-20-5522-0\",\"5522\",\"m\",\"1034-20\",\"Gore-Tex Pro Anorak\",5000,\"6aaec0d6-cbbf-4a38-b4c3-18193bbe8bfa\",\"EN\",[2108],{\"_key\":2109,\"_type\":2110,\"language\":1874,\"value\":2111},\"b71e547ed44e4905bba350df7d43b4a5\",\"internationalizedArrayAnnotatedRichTextValue\",[2112],{\"_key\":2113,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":2114,\"markDefs\":2119,\"style\":1934},\"8b2a8be1020e\",[2115],{\"_key\":2116,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":2117,\"text\":2118},\"cf1fe8c9973c\",[],\"The countdown is nearly over for the opening of Norrøna London store!\",[],[2121],{\"_key\":2122,\"_ref\":2123,\"_type\":1657},\"543c00a7e9fa\",\"ab62a125-29dd-43fc-a779-7a26b5d1bdf1\",[2125],{\"_key\":2126,\"_type\":2127,\"language\":1874,\"value\":2128},\"d7b30e38f9465cbc7b2a07e1d1df04ce\",\"internationalizedArrayContentPortableTextValue\",[2129,2137,2145,2153,2178,2194,2202,2210,2218,2226,2234,2246,2254,2262,2269,2277,2285,2294,2346,2376],{\"_key\":2130,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":2131,\"markDefs\":2136,\"style\":1934},\"d3c2ae3a333c\",[2132],{\"_key\":2133,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":2134,\"text\":1237},\"d4ff63c9402