165,\"pathCdn\":3166,\"products\":3167,\"width\":3168},\"1Zaa5yKjD2l508in6IKfXbuj9FqAMPCOv-741ac0167c7fc082a8085eb9e527c8bb.jpg\",\"Group in Norrøna apparel posing with a small rocket in a desert under a rocket-propelled skier.\",[3150,3155,3159],{\"t\":3151},[3152,34,3153,1727,3154,2819],216218,0.2188,0.7812,{\"t\":3156},[3157,46,1727,1728,1742,3158],216219,0.9889,{\"t\":3160},[3161,1739,3162,1727,3163,2819],216220,0.3594,0.6406,1440,\"tgr-rocket-science-youtube-2560x1440.jpg\",\"Auto\\u002Ftgr-rocket-science-youtube-2560x1440\",[],2560,\"2bfe6977-f068-4a47-8450-fc5bcb7ae270\",[3171],{\"_key\":3172,\"_type\":2110,\"language\":1874,\"value\":3173},\"3a3ae239a96bb6cf2a86207031ecd37a\",[3174],{\"_key\":3175,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3176,\"markDefs\":3181,\"style\":1934},\"58cf066891cc\",[3177],{\"_key\":3178,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3179,\"text\":3180},\"11531531f72d\",[],\"Join us for a screening of TGR’s 31st annual ski film, Actually, It Is Rocket Science at the Norrøna London store\",[],[3183,3186],{\"_key\":3184,\"_ref\":3185,\"_type\":1657},\"45bb45489a27\",\"8ac28afc-0e6c-4ac6-9ff5-f2d5c903c402\",{\"_key\":3187,\"_ref\":3188,\"_type\":1657},\"a0373b911f30\",\"b6b8ad9c-b08d-4a11-8088-47d98022153e\",[3190],{\"_key\":3191,\"_type\":2127,\"language\":1874,\"value\":3192},\"dd136e40ab9fde6730ea1a759ca6c41c\",[3193,3200,3224,3232,3262,3270,3290,3297,3303,3309,3317,3364,3371],{\"_key\":3194,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3195,\"markDefs\":3199,\"style\":1934},\"9f01991ade67\",[3196],{\"_key\":3197,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3198,\"text\":1237},\"c06e01bdb3c9\",[2135],[],{\"_key\":3201,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3202,\"markDefs\":3220,\"style\":1934},\"b76fea5faa50\",[3203,3207,3211,3216],{\"_key\":3204,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3205,\"text\":3206},\"e69c0464ed6c\",[],\"Teton Gravity Research (TGR) is one of the leading action sports filmmakers, capturing the worlds most iconic ski and snowboard moments. Now they are introducing their 31st annual film,\",{\"_key\":3208,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3209,\"text\":3210},\"701243b947e5\",[2291],\" \\\"\",{\"_key\":3212,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3213,\"text\":3215},\"6aef473490cd\",[2291,3214,2135],\"adc4b0f31209\",\"Actually, It Is Rocket Science\",{\"_key\":3217,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3218,\"text\":3219},\"45d293b8d191\",[2291],\"\\\".\",[3221],{\"_key\":3214,\"_type\":3222,\"href\":3223},\"link\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.tetongravity.com\\u002Factually-it-is-rocket-science-tgr-film\\u002F\",{\"_key\":3225,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3226,\"markDefs\":3231,\"style\":1934},\"91921e345efa\",[3227],{\"_key\":3228,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3229,\"text\":3230},\"d83bc8b2666c\",[],\"This year, TGR takes a literal approach to the science of skiing, following some of the world’s best skiers as they push the limits of speed, precision, creativity, and commitment across some of the most consequential terrain on the planet.\",[],{\"_key\":3233,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3234,\"markDefs\":3257,\"style\":1934},\"19634d075d1d\",[3235,3239,3244,3248,3253],{\"_key\":3236,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3237,\"text\":3238},\"41b00aabf6b4\",[],\"We’re excited to see two of our Norrøna ambassadors, \",{\"_key\":3240,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3241,\"text\":3243},\"06daada5107d\",[3242,2135],\"fa220aed3fa5\",\"Teal Harle \",{\"_key\":3245,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3246,\"text\":3247},\"82c72eb1262e\",[],\"and\",{\"_key\":3249,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3250,\"text\":3252},\"e526016ccc2c\",[3251,2135],\"dd64a06f801c\",\" Maggie Voisin\",{\"_key\":3254,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3255,\"text\":3256},\"56a37c48cfc1\",[],\", featured in the film.\",[3258,3260],{\"_key\":3242,\"_type\":3222,\"href\":3259},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.norrona.com\\u002Fen-GB\\u002Fabout-norrona\\u002Four-ambassadors\\u002Fteal-harle\\u002F\",{\"_key\":3251,\"_type\":3222,\"href\":3261},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.norrona.com\\u002Fen-GB\\u002Fabout-norrona\\u002Four-ambassadors\\u002Fmaggie-voisin\\u002F\",{\"_key\":3263,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3264,\"markDefs\":3269,\"style\":1934},\"4c2cca266fb4\",[3265],{\"_key\":3266,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3267,\"text\":3268},\"a5fc2df6fbe2\",[],\"This is a film you truly don’t want to miss!\",[],{\"_key\":3271,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3272,\"markDefs\":3289,\"style\":1934},\"553e347e3bac\",[3273,3277,3281,3285],{\"_key\":3274,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3275,\"text\":3276},\"ba54bba73b21\",[2135],\"After the film, \",{\"_key\":3278,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3279,\"text\":3280},\"39809a0c0983\",[],\"stick around for \",{\"_key\":3282,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3283,\"text\":3284},\"3db4708ec72a\",[2135],\"drinks, snacks, \",{\"_key\":3286,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3287,\"text\":3288},\"87dbaac0b6c2\",[],\"and a chance to hang out with fellow skiers, snowboarders, and mountain people from across the Norrøna community.\",[],{\"_key\":3291,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3292,\"markDefs\":3296,\"style\":1934},\"4b9debe49ca7\",[3293],{\"_key\":3294,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3295,\"text\":3059},\"945246438c3a\",[2135],[],{\"_key\":3062,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3298,\"level\":34,\"listItem\":2176,\"markDefs\":3302,\"style\":1934},[3299],{\"_key\":3065,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3300,\"text\":3301},[],\"When: 10th of December at 19:00\",[],{\"_key\":3070,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3304,\"level\":34,\"listItem\":2176,\"markDefs\":3308,\"style\":1934},[3305],{\"_key\":3073,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3306,\"text\":3307},[],\"Where: Norrøna London\",[],{\"_key\":3310,\"_type\":1926,\"children\":3311,\"level\":34,\"listItem\":2176,\"markDefs\":3316,\"style\":1934},\"2f13b1732edc\",[3312],{\"_key\":3313,\"_type\":1930,\"marks\":3314,\"text\":3315},\"a77b3da31340\",[],\"15 Regent Street, London\",[],{\"_key\":3318,\"_type\":2296,\"displayStyle\":2297,\"image\":3319},\"61b08b2956a7\",{\"_type\":1821,\"mediaItems\":3320},[3321,3345],{\"_key\":3322,\"_type\":1721,\"altText\":3323,\"center\":3326,\"height\":3340,\"id\":3322,\"name\":3341,\"pathCdn\":3342,\"products\":3343,\"width\":3344},\"1K